 The binary package built by packaging/deb/build-deb.sh installs the locked
 runtime dependencies from PyPI into /opt/praxis-prime. Those distributions
 keep their own licenses under each *.dist-info directory and are listed in
 /usr/share/doc/praxis-prime/python-licenses.txt. They are not relicensed
 as MIT.
